			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722130601,
					"content": "喵喵喵，有什麼事嗎？奴家會準備充足的「抱愁」的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130602,
						722130603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寢子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130602,
					"content": "是「報酬」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130605,
					"content": "總之，石頭人…大島先生的工具壞了。不過我們已經給他維修的材料了，應該沒什麼問題！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130606,
					"content": "問題？有什麼問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130607,
						722130608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寢子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130609,
					"content": "那就好。奴家很期待哪，那個奴家的石頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寢子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130610,
					"content": "阿響說，那個石頭的奴家做好了以後，一定會發生什麼好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
